wnloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/deployments","created_at":"2021-07-23T17:26:12Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T10:56:56Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-13T03:02:26Z","git_url":"git://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:NVIDIA/NVFlare.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare","homepage":"https://nvidia.github.io/NVFlare/","size":155939,"stargazers_count":968,"watchers_count":968,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":281,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":30,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["decentralized","federated-analytics","federated-computing","federated-learning","pet","privacy-protection","python"],"visibility":"public","forks":281,"open_issues":30,"watchers":968,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pulls/4513","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/4513","diff_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/4513.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/pull/4513.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-04T19:55:24Z"},"body":"Fixes #4445\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\n`nvflare poc start -gpu 0` was producing the Docker argument `--gpus=0`, which Docker interprets as a *GPU count* (\"give me zero GPUs\") rather than a device selector. Spawned client containers therefore launched with no GPU access — `nvidia-smi` and `torch.cuda.is_available()` both failed inside them.\r\n\r\n`prepare_env()` in `nvflare/tool/poc/poc_commands.py` is now updated to emit the `--gpus=\"device=N\"` form, matching the format already documented by example in the `docker_cln_sh` template comments at [`nvflare/lighter/templates/master_template.yml:709`](https://github.com/NVIDIA/NVFlare/blob/main/nvflare/lighter/templates/master_template.yml#L709). Single-GPU (`-gpu 0`), multi-GPU (`-gpu 0 1`), and \"all\" (`-gpu -1`, resolved upstream by `get_gpu_ids()` to a concrete device list) all flow through the same code path. The non-Docker process-launch path and the no-`-gpu`-flag path are unchanged.\r\n\r\n**Before:** `GPU2USE=--gpus=0` → `docker run --gpus=0 …` → containers run on the host CPU only.\r\n**After:** `GPU2USE=--gpus=\"device=0\"` → `docker run --gpus=\"device=0\" …` → GPU 0 bound into the container.\r\n\r\nFour unit tests added in `tests/unit_test/lighter/poc_commands_test.py` covering: Docker + single GPU, Docker + multi-GPU, Docker + no GPU, non-Docker + GPU.\r\n\r\n### Types of changes\r\n- [x] Non-breaking change (fix or new feature that would not break existing functionality).\r\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or new feature that would cause existing functionality to change).\r\n- [x] New tests added to cover the changes.\r\n- [x] Quick tests passed locally by running `./runtest.sh`.\r\n- [ ] In-line docstrings updated.\r\n- [ ] Documentation updated.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/4513/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/4513/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":25097741784,"node_id":"REFE_lADOFy3KIc7-gT1KzwAAAAXX8SXY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/events/25097741784","actor":{"login":"MohanKrishnaGR","id":113445344,"node_id":"U_kgDOBsMJ4A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113445344?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR","html_url":"https://github.com/MohanKrishnaGR","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MohanKrishnaGR/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"fad75241701c61cf7c7e65475e9a83a0718287ab","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohanKrishnaGR/NVFlare/commits/fad75241701c61cf7c7e65475e9a83a0718287ab","created_at":"2026-05-02T19:29:46Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":25148231939,"node_id":"CE_lADOFy3KIc7-gT1KzwAAAAXa85ED","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/NVFlare/issues/events/25148231939","actor":{"login":"YuanTingHsieh","id":13113932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTEzOTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13113932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.g